  "body": "I can't seem to find a duplicate of this issue(I am a little surprised), but I suspect someone could have submitted this kind of issue. If such is the case, feel free to mark it as a duplicate.\r\n\r\nI don't think any user agents use their shadow root on these elements. I am wondering if there's some other reason for not allowing `ul`, `ol`, `li` to call attachShadow, which I may have missed. Thanks.",
